    "For the 150 units that must be in stock at the end of quarter 4, do they incur a holding cost for quarter 4 (since they are produced but not delivered in quarter 4), or are they exempt from holding cost because they are a required ending inventory?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the holding cost policy for ending inventory, presenting two mutually exclusive options for the user to choose from."
}

